  "body": "Abort ongoing EventSource fetches on BFCache entry. On restoration, fire an error event and reconnect without waiting for the reconnection time.\n\nFixes #12363.\n\n- [ ] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chromium: [Implementation CL](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7742825).\n   * WebKit: pending. Already disconnects/reconnects with an error event, but waits for the reconnection delay.\n   * Gecko: pending. Active `EventSource` appears to prevent BFCache.\n- [ ] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * [WPT PR #59568](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/59568) covers disconnect and reconnect. Event and `readyState` coverage pending agreement on the expected behavior.\n- [ ] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chromium: [358538891](https://issues.chromium.org/issues/358538891).\n   * Gecko: pending.\n   * WebKit: pending.\n   * Deno: not applicable.\n   * Node.js: not applicable.\n- [x] Corresponding [HTML AAM](https://w3c.github.io/html-aam/) & [ARIA in HTML](https://w3c.github.io/html-aria/) issues & PRs: not applicable.\n- [ ] [MDN issue](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) is filed: pending.\n- [x] The top of this comment includes a [clear commit message](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/COMMITTING.md) to use.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12381/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 25, 2026, 11:45 AM UTC (91e75ba)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12381/b3dbeee...91e75ba/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 25, 2026, 11:45 AM UTC (91e75ba)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12381/document-lifecycle.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 25, 2026, 11:45 AM UTC (91e75ba)\">/document-lifecycle.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12381/b3dbeee...91e75ba/document-lifecycle.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 25, 2026, 11:45 AM UTC (91e75ba)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12381/server-sent-events.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 25, 2026, 11:45 AM UTC (91e75ba)\">/server-sent-events.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12381/b3dbeee...91e75ba/server-sent-events.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 25, 2026, 11:45 AM UTC (91e75ba)\">diff</a> )",
